{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">北大嶼山公路多車連環相撞，最少2人受傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網上片段見到，事發後多輛車停在北大嶼山公路往機場方向，近港鐵小蠔灣車廠附近，包括的士及私家車，車頭都嚴重損毀，亦有涉事的車事發後駛至路肩，等待拖車。警員在公路灑上木糠，處理油污。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.LANTAU-1000_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026rnbiFNJSUX1787367558.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TA.LANTAU-1000_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方早上近七時半接報發生多車相撞，最少涉及8輛車，包括5輛私家車及3輛的士。一名的士司機及一名私家車男乘客分別頸痛及胸口痛，清醒送院。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.LANTAU-1000_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026EQlH33uhmq1787367566.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TA.LANTAU-1000_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">受意外影響北大嶼山公路往機場方向，部分行車線一度封閉，交通擠塞。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-22T03:19:41.302436+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}